🚀 BigOvie1: My Personal Space
Welcome to my digital headquarters. This project is a living portfolio that bridges the gap between sonic production and technical development. Built entirely on mobile, it showcases my journey as a musician, artist, and aspiring Google Developer.
🛠 Features
Mobile-First Design: Optimized specifically for high-performance viewing on smartphones.
Gold & Dark Aesthetic: A sleek, high-contrast theme reflecting my artistic brand.
Integrated Gallery: Showcasing live tracks from BandLab and visual art projects.
Smooth Navigation: Seamless scrolling and interactive skill cards.
💻 Tech Stack
Frontend: HTML5, CSS3 (Grid & Flexbox)
Tools: Developed on Android, Hosted via GitHub Pages
Creative: BandLab (Music Production), Digital Illustration

📂 Repository Structure
├── index.html       # Main site structure
├── style.css        # Custom gold-accented styling
├── assets/          # Project images and track covers
└── README.md        # You are here!
